null}, {"sha": "3bb1c2de1b5ae70d154c186acd936db2275ab6cc", "message": "Katlarda resolver ve sorgu tipleri d\u00fczenlendi.  katlar art\u0131k layer olarak de\u011fil floor olarak i\u015fleme al\u0131n\u0131yor. paketler g\u00fcncellendi. proje paket ad\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftirildi.", "created_at": "2025-12-17T16:41:38Z", "repo": "ent-gqlgen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "39809bb4f2730a5e685c057ca77358136eb1813a", "message": "Yeni Ent \u015femalar\u0131 ve GraphQL \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcc\u00fcleri ekleyerek veri modeli ve API katman\u0131n\u0131 geni\u015flet. Dekont i\u00e7in gerekli fonksiyonlar ve tablolar eklendi. Kodda iyile\u015ftirmeler yap\u0131ld\u0131.", "created_at": "2025-12-14T19:05:45Z", "repo": "ent-gqlgen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a918872e83bfda7ff8183b8f38306017657e3b4d", "message": "feat: Implement comprehensive Ent ORM models and GraphQL API for various job, company, and user entities.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:11:10Z", "repo": "ent-gqlgen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e56fd1a944005813fef575207a067453b357a620", "message": "GraphQL \u015femas\u0131na AdministrationCount t\u00fcr\u00fc eklendi ve JobCounts i\u00e7inde administrationCounts alan\u0131 tan\u0131mland\u0131. JobBatchQuery ve JobCounts resolver'lar\u0131nda g\u00fcncellemeler yap\u0131larak, i\u015flerin y\u00f6netimi i\u00e7in yeni i\u015flevsellikler eklendi. Ayr\u0131ca, gereksiz kodlar temizlendi ve baz\u0131 alanlar yeniden d\u00fczenlendi.", "created_at": "2025-03-18T20:46:32Z", "repo": "ent-gqlgen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8e4ef23d29f1ab600443665d19edd7ad08e49d68", "message": "GraphQL \u015femalar\u0131na yeni CompanyBatchResult ve CompanyBatchInput t\u00fcrleri eklendi. UpdateCompany mutasyonu g\u00fcncellenerek UpsertCompany'den \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131ld\u0131. CompanyTokenInput'a CompanyInput alan\u0131 eklendi. CompanyDetailInput'taki Name alan\u0131 iste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131 hale getirildi. Resolver'larda \u015firket g\u00fcncelleme i\u015flevselli\u011fi iyile\u015ftirildi ve gereksiz kodlar temizlendi.", "created_at": "2025-03-16T23:35:54Z", "repo": "ent-gqlgen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "519c6c0b7dcee440e1b714c07e3e795b3b755a89", "message": "GraphQL \u015femalar\u0131nda ve resolver'lar\u0131nda g\u00fcncellemeler yap\u0131ld\u0131; yeni alanlar eklendi, baz\u0131 alanlar kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131 ve i\u015flevsellikler g\u00fcncellendi. Upsert i\u015flemleri i\u00e7in yeni mutasyonlar eklendi. Ayr\u0131ca, JobDetail ve JobPayments ile ilgili sorgulamalar ve ili\u015fkiler g\u00fcncellendi.", "created_at": "2025-03-16T22:07:33Z", "repo": "ent-gqlgen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "98a2669f5bc89d1b148b37f04e7750ca9a27543a", "message": "\u0130li\u015fkiler JobDetail'den \u00e7\u0131kart\u0131ld\u0131, JobRelations ad\u0131nda bir tablo olu\u015fturuldu ili\u015fkiler buradan y\u00f6netiliyor.\n\nBir\u00e7ok dosyada JobDetail yerine JobRelations kullan\u0131larak g\u00fcncellemeler yap\u0131ld\u0131. Ayr\u0131ca, baz\u0131 dosyalar silindi ve i\u015flevsellikleri kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131.\n\nJobBatch fonksiyonu eklendi.\ngraph dosya ad\u0131 graphql olarak de\u011fi\u015ftiirldi.\nhandlers mod\u00fcl\u00fc kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131.", "created_at": "2025-03-13T17:09:49Z", "repo": "ent-gqlgen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3dab701f49088040e16d15a2d707d372f3229c24", "message": "create company role check", "created_at": "2025-02-07T20:26:53Z", "repo": "ent-gqlgen", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3168c49c871f519bac9d4da4155dd4e3c5d90b08", "message": "add license expired func", "created_at": "2025-02-07T20:09:45Z", "repo": "ent-gqlgen",